#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as enacted the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as enacted the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as enacted the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 63(1) as amended, guidelines
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as amended the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as amended the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as amended the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 63(1) the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner: before the group applies (NOTHING), from the day it applies (the text as amended), and each fact missing in turn
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the as-enacted guidelines (direct call): the Commission develops guidelines considering the needs of microenterprises, without affecting the level of protection
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as enacted the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(1) as enacted the Commission has developed guidelines on the elements of the quality management system which may be complied with in a simplified manner` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 63(2)
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) paragraph 1 exempts the operator from fulfilling other requirements or obligations laid down in this Regulation` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) paragraph 1 exempts the operator from fulfilling other requirements or obligations laid down in this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) paragraph 1 exempts the operator from fulfilling other requirements or obligations laid down in this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 63(2): "including those established in Articles 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 72 and 73": the named Articles, and every other requirement of the Regulation by the general words
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` (Date 2 8 2026) 9 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` (Date 2 8 2026) 15 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` (Date 2 8 2026) 72 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` (Date 2 8 2026) 73 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` (Date 2 8 2026) 8 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` (Date 2 8 2026) 16 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` (Date 1 8 2026) 9 EQUALS NOTHING
